	'com_look_t' => 'On the visit',
	'commercial_0_b' => 'A small commercial building, for this practice, is a shop, an office or a workshop up to 400 m². The flat above is included when there is one. The survey is a full condition report, the same ledger we use on a house: structure, roof and rainwater, damp and ventilation, walls and windows, services we can see, the inside, the outside, and priorities in three columns.',
	'commercial_0_c' => 'Services stay visual only. We do not test electrics, heating or drains, and we do not lift fixed floors. The report is in plain words, with a photograph for every finding, and it is sent within five working days, followed by a 30-minute call. It is not a valuation. We do not work for the seller or the agent.',
	'commercial_0_h' => 'Shops, offices and workshops',
	'commercial_1_b' => 'Henrik Saari looks at the shopfront, the flat roofs, the fire escape and the separation between the shop and the flat. The shopfront takes in the fascia, the stallriser and the way the frame meets the brick or render. Flat roofs are where ponding shows, and we record it from where we can see the felt without walking on it. We never walk on roofs.',
	'commercial_1_c' => 'The fire escape note says whether the route we could see is clear. Separation is the wall, the floor and the doors between the shop and any flat above: what is shared, and what is not. Ines Kovač, the founder, also surveys commercial buildings and older houses. On a shop with a flat, Henrik is the surveyor named for the visit.',
	'commercial_1_h' => 'What Henrik looks at',
	'commercial_2_b' => 'The small commercial building survey is EUR 1,150. That covers a shop, office or workshop up to 400 m², including a flat above, and about 4 hours on site. Prices include VAT and travel within 40 km of Elsmere Quay. Every full report includes a 30-minute call. You pay after the report is sent, within 14 days.',
	'commercial_2_c' => 'The report itself arrives within five working days of the visit. Lucía Pardo confirms the fixed price and the visit slot within one working day of the request. A single crack, damp patch or leak, looked at on its own, is the separate single-defect inspection at EUR 290, with a short letter in two working days.',
	'commercial_2_h' => 'Price',
	'commercial_3_b' => 'Sana Iqbal was buying a corner shop with a flat above. Henrik surveyed it. The finding that set the timing was ponding on the rear felt flat roof. The report recommended a roofer\'s quote before exchange. The seller re-covered the roof. We did not obtain the quote and we did not arrange the covering.',
	'commercial_3_c' => 'We do not sell or arrange repairs. The photograph of the ponding and the plain sentence under it were what Sana had before exchange. The full case sits with our other case notes. The visit was a full commercial report, about half a day, not a forty-five-minute single-defect letter.',
	'commercial_3_h' => 'A corner shop with a flat above',
	'commercial_4_b' => 'Three photographs sit with this work. The centre of them is ponding on a felt flat roof behind a shop with a flat above, the same kind of roof as Sana\'s. Beside it, an upstairs floor falling 18 mm towards the front wall, which is the sort of slope we record when the flat over a shop has moved.',
	'commercial_4_c' => 'The third is a surveyor on the pavement raising a pole camera to the roof and gutter of a two-storey building. That is how we see gutters and coverings we do not walk. In frost or rain the report says plainly what could not be seen. Each finding still gets one photograph and one sentence.',
	'commercial_4_h' => 'What the photographs show',
	'commercial_i' => 'We survey shops, offices and workshops up to 400 m², with or without a flat above, before a buyer commits. Henrik Saari carries these visits. The time on site is about four hours, half a day.',
	'commercial_l' => 'Small commercial',
	'commercial_t' => 'Small commercial',
	'contact_0_b' => 'Noki Surveyors, 3 Ropewalk Yard, Elsmere Quay. The office is where the reports are written and where the afternoon is spent when there is not a second visit. It is not a showroom, and we do not keep a trade counter for repairs. We do not sell or arrange repairs.',
	'contact_0_c' => 'If you are coming for a conversation about a report you have already received, write first so Lucía can set the 30-minute call, which is part of every full report. The survey itself happens at the building, within 40 km of Elsmere Quay, not in the office.',
	'contact_0_h' => 'Address',
	'contact_1_b' => 'Phone +00 31 555 0148. Email hello@noki-surveyors.example. The request desk is open Monday to Friday, 08:30–17:30. Site visits run Monday to Saturday, 08:00–17:00, and Saturday is by arrangement. At 17:00 Lucía confirms the next day\'s slots and replies to the day\'s requests, which is why a message sent in desk hours is answered within one working day.',
	'contact_1_c' => 'Outside those hours the mail waits for the next desk morning. The surveyors are on site from 08:30. The van is loaded at 07:45 with the ladder, the pole camera, the damp meter and the torch.',
	'contact_1_h' => 'Phone, email and hours',
	'contact_2_b' => 'We survey houses and small commercial buildings within 40 km of Elsmere Quay. Travel inside that distance is included in the price, and VAT is included too. The six list prices run from EUR 160 for a re-visit to EUR 1,150 for a small commercial building.',
	'contact_2_c' => 'When you write, give the address so we can see that the building sits inside the area before we offer a slot. A request from outside the 40 km is answered as well, within one working day, so you are not left wondering. The published prices apply inside the area.',
	'contact_2_h' => 'The area we cover',
	'contact_3_b' => 'The contact form asks for your name, your email, a message, and your consent. The button says Send message. If the form is not available, email hello@noki-surveyors.example. The fallback button says Email the request desk, with the subject Message for Noki Surveyors.',
	'contact_3_c' => 'Use it for a question about a booking, a report, or whether a building sits in the area. For a new survey, the useful message still carries the address, the type of building and the date you need the report by. When we have replied through the form, the confirmation reads: Thank you. Lucía will reply within one working day.',
	'contact_3_h' => 'Email the request desk',
	'contact_4_b' => 'Lucía Pardo reads the desk. She books every visit and writes the reply. She does not pass your enquiry to the seller or the agent. We do not work for them. The report, once it exists, is for the named client only, unless you choose to share it.',
	'contact_4_c' => 'A question about cracks, damp or a roof is welcome before you decide which survey to book. If you already know, ask for the survey directly and Lucía will answer with the fixed price and the slot. The practice was founded in 2011 by Ines Kovač, and the desk has been the front of it since.',
